cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "QuPath Hepatocyte Extension: run the hepatocyte-app liver segmentation model on QuPath annotations"
abstract: >
  A QuPath 0.6+ extension that packages the sbalci/hepatocyte-app deep-learning
  liver H&E segmentation workflow as one-click menu entries under
  "Extensions → Hepatocyte". It supports batch slide import into a QuPath project,
  MPP-aware tissue auto-detection (current slide or whole project), and
  TorchScript segmentation inference on selected ROIs or across an entire project
  via the Python bridge (hepatocyte_qupath_inference.py), importing predictions
  back as classified cell polygons with per-class counts and Excel reports.
  The model emits five morphological classes (Balloon dystrophy, Mesenchymal,
  Non-nuclear, Normal, Steatosis); no clinical grade or score is derived.
  Research and education only.
